WEBVTT

00:01.730 --> 00:04.970
They took Tama somewhere else.

00:07.610 --> 00:10.730
Were we arrested because of her?

00:11.220 --> 00:14.780
They arrested her and everyone she 
was with the moment they saw her.

00:14.780 --> 00:18.500
Tama must've committed 
a terrible crime here.

00:18.500 --> 00:21.230
Maybe she stole from royalty.

00:21.230 --> 00:23.820
Tama isn't a thieving cat!

00:23.820 --> 00:25.680
By the way, Annette-kun...

00:26.090 --> 00:31.580
How do they execute people in this world?

00:32.430 --> 00:35.050
I'm not telling someone who's 
making that expression.

00:35.050 --> 00:39.010
<b>HEH HEH HEH</b>

00:39.320 --> 00:43.380
I-In any case, we should try to escape, 
even if it's without her.

00:43.380 --> 00:44.240
Escape?

00:44.240 --> 00:46.090
But how?

00:49.020 --> 00:53.190
Th-That's hardly the skill of a valiant warrior.

00:55.230 --> 00:56.010
Huh?

00:56.830 --> 00:59.170
S-Sensei...

01:00.170 --> 01:03.130
Why'd you have to go and do that?

01:03.130 --> 01:06.080
Couldn't at least one of you praise me?!

01:06.310 --> 01:08.530
Hey! What are you doing?

01:10.740 --> 01:13.480
You. Hey, you.

01:14.090 --> 01:17.260
We'll be executed, won't we?

01:17.260 --> 01:19.790
Wh-What's wrong with you, you creep?

02:45.900 --> 02:49.400
<b>No Longer Allowed               in Another World</b>

02:49.400 --> 02:50.700
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:50.700 --> 02:53.950
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:55.030 --> 02:59.740
The crimes you've committed 
are quite severe.

03:00.230 --> 03:04.200
Therefore, you shall be executed.

03:02.490 --> 03:04.200
<b>Kingdom of Grün</b>

03:02.490 --> 03:04.200
<b>Minister</b>

03:02.490 --> 03:04.200
<b>Briyard</b>

03:04.850 --> 03:06.820
W-Wait! Why?!

03:07.290 --> 03:11.280
You kidnapped our 
kingdom's princess, Matilda.

03:11.290 --> 03:14.000
<b>Kingdom of Grün</b>

03:11.290 --> 03:14.000
<b>King</b>

03:11.290 --> 03:14.000
<b>Syberian</b>

03:11.840 --> 03:14.010
Execution is the appropriate punishment.

03:14.010 --> 03:15.970
K-Kidnapped a princess?

03:15.970 --> 03:18.020
We never did anything like—

03:17.290 --> 03:18.810
Father!

03:19.260 --> 03:22.290
I told you, I wasn't kidnapped!

03:22.300 --> 03:24.260
<b>Kingdom of Grün</b>

03:22.300 --> 03:24.260
<b>Princess</b>

03:22.300 --> 03:24.260
<b>Matilda</b>

03:24.890 --> 03:26.740
How many times do I have to tell you?

03:26.740 --> 03:30.130
I was just visiting the various nations 
to improve my martial skills!

03:30.380 --> 03:32.860
And I met them on my travels!

03:32.860 --> 03:34.120
Right, Annette?

03:34.120 --> 03:36.600
A-As you say, Your Highness.

03:36.600 --> 03:38.560
You don't have to treat me differently now!

03:39.020 --> 03:43.320
Anyway, that's that. 
Release them immediately, Father.

03:43.660 --> 03:44.580
I will not.

03:44.580 --> 03:46.170
Father!

03:48.320 --> 03:49.030
However...

03:49.330 --> 03:54.640
If you'll do as I say, I shall 
release them this instant.

03:55.570 --> 03:57.330
Listen to me, Matilda.

03:57.620 --> 04:01.420
Swear you'll never do anything foolish again

04:01.420 --> 04:04.190
and will act in a manner 
befitting a child of royalty,

04:04.550 --> 04:07.790
like your mother, Lapama.

04:18.130 --> 04:20.230
Very well, Father.

04:22.560 --> 04:27.340
I swear I shall act in a manner 
befitting a princess from now on.

04:29.430 --> 04:31.120
Sorry, guys.

04:32.500 --> 04:35.510
This is where our journey together ends.

04:37.150 --> 04:38.750
Thanks for everything.

04:41.670 --> 04:45.650
All of you are free to go.

04:48.960 --> 04:51.690
Nothing beats a meal in the free world!

04:52.020 --> 04:54.420
Could we get some more 
meat over here, miss?

04:54.420 --> 04:55.560
Yes, sir.

04:55.560 --> 04:59.750
Nir, don't behave so crudely.

05:00.600 --> 05:05.070
And Sensei, don't be so despondent 
just because you weren't executed.

05:05.070 --> 05:07.340
Anyway, I'm surprised.

05:07.340 --> 05:10.860
I had no idea Tama was the 
princess of this nation.

05:10.860 --> 05:12.420
Indeed.

05:13.220 --> 05:16.890
I've been unbelievably rude 
to her countless times.

05:17.580 --> 05:20.080
It wouldn't surprise me if I were executed.

05:17.580 --> 05:20.650
Ow, ow, ow!

05:20.080 --> 05:23.570
Not only that, but despite her 
having a lovely name like Matilda,

05:23.570 --> 05:26.050
we've been calling her Tama.

05:26.050 --> 05:27.390
Matilda...

05:28.040 --> 05:32.190
Um... Do you know Princess Matilda?

05:32.190 --> 05:34.160
What? Y-Yes...

05:34.160 --> 05:35.510
Oh, I apologize.

05:35.830 --> 05:38.090
My name is Fawne.

05:38.090 --> 05:42.490
I used to serve Princess Matilda in 
the palace as her lady in waiting.

05:42.490 --> 05:45.850
Are you friends of the princess?

05:45.850 --> 05:49.900
Yeah. Until yesterday, 
we were traveling together,

05:50.330 --> 05:53.300
but the king dragged her back to the castle.

05:53.550 --> 05:56.770
I guess it can't be helped 
since she's the princess.

05:56.770 --> 06:00.120
I see. The king did that...

06:01.040 --> 06:03.820
Fawne-kun, I'd like to place an order.

06:04.250 --> 06:08.540
You seem to know what happened 
between the two of them.

06:09.030 --> 06:13.130
Could you tell us about it?

06:13.460 --> 06:17.490
You want to know about 
Princess Matilda's past?

06:17.760 --> 06:20.680
When I first met Tama,

06:21.680 --> 06:25.390
she had been captured by a tree monster.

06:23.700 --> 06:25.410
<b>m 0 0 l 192 0 192 24 0 24</b>

06:23.700 --> 06:25.410
<b>Death Tree has appeared.</b>

06:26.360 --> 06:30.560
And now she's been confined 
to the castle by her father.

06:32.180 --> 06:35.210
She's a truly interesting woman.

06:35.210 --> 06:39.090
It would be harder not to be interested in her.

06:39.470 --> 06:46.000
But now that we know she's a princess, 
it would be rude to pry into her past.

06:46.000 --> 06:50.080
Yeah, Sensei. You should be careful 
about casually calling her Tama, too.

06:50.410 --> 06:52.760
It matters not to me if she's a princess

06:52.760 --> 06:56.560
or a woman in a bar in the back streets of Ginza.

06:57.270 --> 06:59.510
She is Tama.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.980
Very well.

07:03.410 --> 07:06.880
I'll tell you what I know.

07:13.390 --> 07:17.330
When Annette and Nir realized 
I was a princess...

07:19.880 --> 07:22.120
Sensei acted like his usual self.

07:23.530 --> 07:26.850
I wonder what they're up to now.

07:29.600 --> 07:32.440
There's a person up there?

07:43.630 --> 07:46.100
What happened here?

07:46.910 --> 07:52.830
Huh. So this is Grün, the land 
where various demis congregate.

07:53.480 --> 07:56.530
I haven't eaten a demi woman yet.

07:57.190 --> 08:00.170
I wonder what their flesh tastes like.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.500
Who are you?

08:03.200 --> 08:05.480
My name is Kaibara.

08:05.480 --> 08:09.390
I'm one of the heroes who killed 
the Dark Lord and saved the world.

08:10.850 --> 08:15.940
Though now I'm apparently known 
as the Fallen Angel of Gluttony.

08:16.760 --> 08:19.010
The Fallen Angel of Gluttony...

08:19.370 --> 08:22.720
You're one of the individuals Hellsehen 
calls the Seven Fallen Angels.

08:23.450 --> 08:25.150
What are you doing here?

08:25.880 --> 08:27.800
Isn't it obvious?

08:28.580 --> 08:32.290
I came to consume this entire nation!

08:34.000 --> 08:35.810
<i>He's Gifted.</i>

08:37.870 --> 08:40.240
You came to the wrong place.

08:40.540 --> 08:44.720
We'll show you why they call 
Grün a nation of warriors!

08:46.490 --> 08:47.950
Good grief.

09:00.060 --> 09:04.520
As I thought, sinewy and 
tough. Hardly edible.

09:04.930 --> 09:09.860
They call me gluttonous, but I'm 
particular about what I eat.

09:10.260 --> 09:14.430
Listen, I don't want to eat 
disgusting meat like this.

09:14.850 --> 09:16.140
I want women.

09:17.280 --> 09:21.110
I want the soft flesh of a young demi woman.

09:21.590 --> 09:23.450
Stand back, all of you.

09:23.810 --> 09:26.660
You'll face him yourself, Your Majesty?

09:27.350 --> 09:29.130
Kaibara, was it?

09:29.480 --> 09:33.700
As the king of the nation, I shall 
not allow you to leave alive.

09:34.220 --> 09:38.680
<b>m 0 0 l 170 0 170 24 0 24</b>

09:34.220 --> 09:38.680
<b>Syberian - King</b>

09:34.570 --> 09:38.430
Taste my Divine Beast Fist!

09:39.470 --> 09:41.880
A warrior king, eh?

09:42.210 --> 09:44.050
Interesting.

09:56.900 --> 09:58.400
Tiger Kick!

09:58.790 --> 10:00.650
Not bad.

10:00.650 --> 10:01.900
Wildcat Palm!

10:01.900 --> 10:03.440
Thunderbolt!

10:09.080 --> 10:10.330
Just kidding.

10:14.490 --> 10:17.390
You're still standing after 
being struck by my Wildcat Palm?

10:17.790 --> 10:21.380
That would've killed a normal person.

10:21.810 --> 10:25.850
But my body is extraordinarily tough...

10:25.850 --> 10:29.570
because I ate a bunch of 
golems the other day.

10:41.390 --> 10:44.750
My king, are you going to use 
your ultimate technique?

10:44.750 --> 10:48.220
Do you intend to destroy him 
instead of capturing him?

10:48.830 --> 10:51.490
He killed my men.

10:51.850 --> 10:54.450
He doesn't deserve mercy.

10:55.260 --> 10:56.660
Kaibara...

10:57.390 --> 11:01.270
With a single strike, I will destroy you.

11:10.360 --> 11:11.430
Father!

11:12.550 --> 11:13.470
Matilda!

11:15.990 --> 11:19.780
Found a demi woman.

11:22.050 --> 11:24.930
<i>He was on the roof earlier.</i>

11:31.300 --> 11:33.250
I'll fight with you, Father!

11:33.530 --> 11:34.620
Fool!

11:34.620 --> 11:35.990
Get back!

11:36.370 --> 11:39.410
Don't think you can replace Leon!

11:41.920 --> 11:45.670
Princess Matilda had a twin brother.

11:46.110 --> 11:48.510
Her brother's name was Leon.

11:48.510 --> 11:52.070
He was the prince set to 
inherit the throne of Grün.

11:52.770 --> 11:56.850
The valiant Prince Leon and 
the kind Princess Matilda.

11:57.610 --> 12:02.330
Everyone in the nation 
believed that with these two,

12:02.330 --> 12:05.360
peace in Grün would be everlasting.

12:06.040 --> 12:11.340
Until the night of the storm ten years ago...

12:13.540 --> 12:16.630
During a cave-in on their 
way back to the castle,

12:16.630 --> 12:21.760
Prince Leon and Queen Lapama 
suddenly departed this world.

12:21.760 --> 12:23.260
No...

12:23.260 --> 12:29.230
The king grieved them deeply and 
was in low spirits for a long time.

12:30.420 --> 12:34.090
Lapama... Leon...

12:41.060 --> 12:44.060
B-But Your Highness, I could never...

12:44.400 --> 12:47.780
It's fine, Fawne. Please.

12:52.730 --> 12:55.530
Fawne, I've made up my mind.

12:56.430 --> 13:00.740
I will take Leon's place and 
put my father's mind at ease.

13:03.870 --> 13:08.020
I see. What a painful past...

13:11.100 --> 13:14.940
But contrary to Princess Matilda's desires,

13:15.290 --> 13:19.240
a deep rift formed between the two of them.

13:19.860 --> 13:21.440
Can't you hear me, Matilda?

13:21.680 --> 13:24.450
Your martial arts are utterly useless!

13:24.770 --> 13:27.170
What's your problem? I...

13:27.170 --> 13:28.690
I can fight, too!

13:28.690 --> 13:29.620
Matilda!

13:29.910 --> 13:32.200
Then I won't hold back.

13:32.570 --> 13:34.260
I'll enjoy this meal.

13:51.070 --> 13:52.680
Father!

13:53.060 --> 13:56.430
Is this what they call love 
between a parent and child?

13:56.430 --> 13:58.530
You've shown me something beautiful.

13:59.190 --> 14:02.000
I was hoping to taste 
your ultimate technique,

14:02.000 --> 14:04.490
but you won't be able 
to use it with that arm.

14:08.690 --> 14:12.340
Sorry. I ate it.

14:18.330 --> 14:19.760
Come to me!

14:24.220 --> 14:27.820
Aw, darn. My meal ran away.

14:27.820 --> 14:30.170
That was one reckless old man.

14:30.490 --> 14:34.230
No matter. I'll save my main dish for later.

14:35.090 --> 14:36.140
Now, then...

14:36.550 --> 14:40.620
How should I enjoy this dish?

14:44.450 --> 14:48.340
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

14:44.960 --> 14:48.340
Someone Who
Wants to Be
Eaten Has
Come to
the Castle

14:48.340 --> 14:49.170
Someone Who
Wants to Be
Eaten Has
Come to
the Castle

14:48.340 --> 14:49.210
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

14:49.170 --> 14:49.210
Someone Who
Wants to Be
Eaten Has
Come to
the Castle

14:49.210 --> 14:49.250
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

14:49.210 --> 14:49.250
Someone Who
Wants to Be
Eaten Has
Come to
the Castle

14:49.260 --> 14:49.300
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

14:49.300 --> 14:49.380
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

14:49.380 --> 14:49.420
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

14:52.770 --> 14:56.040
Thank you for the precious story, Fawne-kun.

14:56.040 --> 14:58.240
Sensei, what have you been writing?

15:02.830 --> 15:04.340
Lord Briyard!

15:04.340 --> 15:07.500
Ah, Fawne. It's good to see you again.

15:07.500 --> 15:09.460
P-Princess Matilda!

15:09.460 --> 15:12.720
Don't worry. She's simply unconscious.

15:12.980 --> 15:16.090
We had to make a bit of a wild escape.

15:16.090 --> 15:17.830
Escape? What do you mean?

15:17.830 --> 15:24.250
Castle Grün just fell to the evil 
Other Worlder who suddenly showed up.

15:24.250 --> 15:25.050
What?

15:28.360 --> 15:29.290
What happened?

15:28.880 --> 15:30.140
What the...

15:29.290 --> 15:30.140
What's going on?

15:30.140 --> 15:31.330
What is that?

15:36.490 --> 15:38.220
Y-Your Majesty!

15:38.220 --> 15:39.950
King Syberian!

15:40.480 --> 15:43.960
People of Grün, how do you do?

15:44.320 --> 15:46.390
My name is Kaibara.

15:46.390 --> 15:49.420
As you can see, I'm the new king of this land.

15:49.970 --> 15:52.000
Don't worry, everyone.

15:52.000 --> 15:55.500
I'm not here to oppress you.

15:56.010 --> 15:59.400
There's only one thing I want 
to do now that I'm king.

15:59.760 --> 16:06.650
I want to taste the flesh of all the 
varieties of demi who live here.

16:07.360 --> 16:11.230
I only want to eat women 
and children, of course.

16:11.230 --> 16:14.900
The men can continue working as usual.

16:15.450 --> 16:18.660
That is my only desire.

16:19.880 --> 16:21.630
Get down here, crazy!

16:21.630 --> 16:22.960
We'll beat you to a pulp!

16:27.120 --> 16:31.370
It was misleading of me to say 
"only women and children."

16:31.370 --> 16:33.710
A family never wants to be apart, do they?

16:34.130 --> 16:36.730
If you desire, I shall eat demi men, as well.

16:37.080 --> 16:40.460
You can be together again inside my stomach.

16:42.170 --> 16:44.700
Just so you know, there's 
no point in trying to run.

16:45.010 --> 16:49.730
I've stationed monsters who used to 
serve the Dark Lord all over town.

16:52.440 --> 16:55.880
See you at the dinner table, everyone.

16:58.270 --> 17:01.690
He's unbelievable. Totally insane.

17:04.770 --> 17:10.050
Recently confined by your father, now 
you're the princess of a fallen nation...

17:11.380 --> 17:14.180
You truly are the heroine of a tragedy.

17:14.990 --> 17:17.270
But Tama...

17:18.470 --> 17:25.310
The heroine I seek never 
meekly accepts tragedy.

17:25.890 --> 17:32.100
Now open your eyes and show 
me the rest of your story.

17:35.020 --> 17:36.930
Listen to me, Matilda.

17:44.090 --> 17:46.670
Listen closely to what I'm about to say.

17:52.930 --> 17:54.960
Ow...

17:56.280 --> 17:59.050
Is this Fawne's house?

18:03.620 --> 18:04.940
Princess Matilda!

18:04.940 --> 18:07.450
Fawne! Annette and Nir, too!

18:07.450 --> 18:09.130
What happened?

18:09.130 --> 18:14.120
That man captured the royal capital 
and is trying to eat our citizens.

18:14.120 --> 18:15.910
He ate the king's arm, too.

18:19.830 --> 18:20.930
Wait.

18:20.930 --> 18:24.320
Let go of me, Briyard! I have to defeat him!

18:24.320 --> 18:25.170
You mustn't!

18:25.170 --> 18:28.110
Not even the king stood a chance against him!

18:29.180 --> 18:32.330
My father was defeated because 
he was protecting me.

18:33.120 --> 18:34.160
Besides...

18:34.430 --> 18:38.800
I have a responsibility to protect this 
nation in my brother Leon's place.

18:39.080 --> 18:40.290
But Your Highness...

18:40.290 --> 18:42.870
This is a problem I have to solve.

18:44.230 --> 18:46.360
The Tragedy of Klolone Pass.

18:47.980 --> 18:51.440
Fawne's story reminded 
me of the terrible accident

18:51.440 --> 18:56.410
that took the lives of two members 
of the royal family ten years ago.

18:56.740 --> 19:00.100
I had no idea they were 
your mother and brother.

19:00.480 --> 19:05.840
I hear there wasn't a single citizen who 
didn't shed a tear when they heard the news.

19:05.840 --> 19:11.300
There is no stronger proof that the royalty 
of this nation are beloved by the people.

19:11.790 --> 19:16.290
If they lose you as well, 
the people will lose hope.

19:17.170 --> 19:20.020
Let us handle this.

19:20.020 --> 19:24.790
As this nation's princess, you 
mustn't put yourself in danger now.

19:25.170 --> 19:26.200
But...

19:26.640 --> 19:27.990
It's all right.

19:27.990 --> 19:33.560
You didn't see it then, but we have a 
secret for defeating Other Worlders.

19:33.840 --> 19:35.380
Right, Sensei?

19:37.130 --> 19:41.490
Let's go, Annette-kun, Nir-kun, and Melos.

19:41.490 --> 19:42.900
What? Me, too?

19:49.330 --> 19:52.290
You have good friends.

19:56.550 --> 20:00.260
<b>m 0 0 l 147 0 147 52 0 52</b>

19:56.550 --> 20:00.260
<b>Gatekeeper Ogre A and 
Gatekeeper Ogre B 
have appeared.</b>

19:56.920 --> 20:00.270
We were ordered to kill 
everyone who comes here.

20:00.720 --> 20:01.720
We're gonna kill you.

20:01.720 --> 20:04.660
Sensei and Nir, stand back.

20:09.490 --> 20:12.600
We've come to be eaten.

20:12.900 --> 20:13.810
What?

20:14.190 --> 20:18.660
I was deeply moved by the 
new king's speech earlier.

20:18.660 --> 20:20.020
Wh-What?

20:20.020 --> 20:24.410
I am constantly thinking 
about death and how to die.

20:24.410 --> 20:30.990
But until I heard that speech, it had never 
occurred to me to be eaten to death.

20:30.990 --> 20:32.910
What? Sensei...

20:32.910 --> 20:36.240
Now hurry and tell the new king.

20:36.870 --> 20:40.540
"Someone who wants to be eaten 
has come to the castle."

20:40.540 --> 20:41.220
What?!

20:41.590 --> 20:47.870
The new king seemed to want demis. 
Will he eat a human, as well?

20:47.870 --> 20:48.550
H-Hey...

20:48.560 --> 20:52.890
<b>m 0 0 l 170 0 170 24 0 24</b>

20:48.560 --> 20:52.890
<b>The monsters are confused.</b>

20:48.780 --> 20:50.560
What do we do with this freak?

20:50.560 --> 20:52.900
I wasn't expecting him to request this.

20:52.900 --> 20:55.900
Well? Will you relay our message or not?

20:55.650 --> 20:59.110
<b>Sensei is agitated.</b>

20:55.900 --> 20:59.100
C-Calm down, he who wishes to be eaten.

20:59.100 --> 21:04.600
O gods, please save your wretched servants!

21:05.340 --> 21:07.380
There are no gods...

21:07.380 --> 21:09.360
Cease that disgraceful behavior.

21:09.360 --> 21:12.280
Whose fault do you think this is?

21:13.400 --> 21:15.470
Death is a good thing,

21:15.470 --> 21:17.760
but now is not the time to say that.

21:19.420 --> 21:21.830
Come, valiant warrior.

21:22.220 --> 21:23.500
Your services are needed.

22:55.260 --> 22:59.230
I've brought you some soup, Princess Matilda.

23:00.070 --> 23:03.930
Good grief. That incorrigible tomboy.

23:05.220 --> 23:06.910
Now...

23:06.910 --> 23:09.880
It's time for my first dinner.

23:09.880 --> 23:11.870
Which demi shall I eat first?

23:12.350 --> 23:14.030
K-King Kaibara!

23:14.030 --> 23:16.080
We have something to tell you!

23:16.360 --> 23:19.240
A strange human arrived earlier.

23:19.240 --> 23:22.100
He wants to be eaten by you.

23:28.870 --> 23:31.060
Ah, I knew you would come.

23:32.020 --> 23:34.010
Fool...

